			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3565519">
									

<p>I think there's potential in expanding on the contradictory perspectives of A and B. A clearly describes that B takes on characteristics that she fears, implying that her mind formulated its appearance. However, B notes that they come from a Monsters Inc. kind of setting&#8230; but they think it's weird that the doctor didn't have a boogeyman. Could be an interesting &quot;chicken or the egg&quot; scenario.</p>

